    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Startup Description (100 words max)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Key points to cover:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Market**: $50B+ creative tools market, growing with remote work"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Problem**: Teams struggle with visual collaboration, scattered tools, poor real-time sync"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Solution**: Infinite canvas with real-time multiplayer, drag-and-drop content, layered organization"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Unique Approach**: ZeroSync-powered real-time collaboration + depth-based 3D layering"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Team**: Technical founder with deep web3/fullstack experience"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Sample description:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> \"Canvas Engine revolutionizes team collaboration with an infinite visual workspace powered by real-time multiplayer synchronization. Teams can drag-and-drop any content onto shared canvases, organize with depth-based layering, and collaborate seamlessly in real-time. Built on ZeroSync for instant synchronization and modern web technologies for cross-platform accessibility.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
